{"4171050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VIVID", "steam_appid": 4171050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/beffdd4c72a8361b8e9365203b7410a4.avif?t=1787386762\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras_big/beffdd4c72a8361b8e9365203b7410a4.webp?t=1787386762 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the life of a plant in a calm, atmospheric exploration game about growth, responsibility, and the long-term impact of humans' actions on our environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a living, reactive world shaped by procedural systems, <strong>VIVID</strong> invites you to slow down. Observe how plants grow, how ecosystems evolve, and how even small decisions can leave lasting traces. Ecological responsibility and long-term consequences are central themes – mechanically and narratively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/72fa6ae8c0e1ce074c7bb8343e1cbf76.avif?t=1787386762\" alt=\"DIVIDER: Play at your own pace!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras_big/72fa6ae8c0e1ce074c7bb8343e1cbf76.webp?t=1787386762 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/43dddc08726e40cdcd7eb10ac1d132f4.poster.avif?t=1787386762\" width=454 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/43dddc08726e40cdcd7eb10ac1d132f4.webm?t=1787386762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/43dddc08726e40cdcd7eb10ac1d132f4.mp4?t=1787386762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no rush, no constant pressure – only space for curiosity, reflection and meaningful interaction with nature. You can pause at any time to take well considered decisions – or just to enjoy the scenery. But be careful, every action is permanent, as there is no way to turn back time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/6360d2196f802f49ba12187bf41e6d52.avif?t=1787386762\" alt=\"DIVIDER: Adjust your metabolism!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras_big/6360d2196f802f49ba12187bf41e6d52.webp?t=1787386762 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/591b1a77b8c52e178491ff09005b40be.poster.avif?t=1787386762\" width=458 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/591b1a77b8c52e178491ff09005b40be.webm?t=1787386762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/591b1a77b8c52e178491ff09005b40be.mp4?t=1787386762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use metabolism points to refine your resource intake &amp; production in relation to the selected biome. Each environment offers unique challenges to overcome and varying resource availabilities to adjust to – a diverse and mixed forest differs a lot from a smog-ridden metropolitan city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/9afa281a29c13c3c2a5807faecff8028.avif?t=1787386762\" alt=\"DIVIDER: Specialize yourself!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras_big/9afa281a29c13c3c2a5807faecff8028.webp?t=1787386762 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/492169dd881ae7aaba3c9b72ae0c35cb.poster.avif?t=1787386762\" width=582 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/492169dd881ae7aaba3c9b72ae0c35cb.mp4?t=1787386762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide wisely on which paths to specialize yourself in. Every plant comes with a different skill tree resembling it’s unique strengths &amp; qualities in real nature. Enhance your abilities and unlock skills on multiple paths like water-, and resource-intake, photosynthesis or producing defensive pesticides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/22e391b275fddc44458bc8e31c714ff8.avif?t=1787386762\" alt=\"DIVIDER: React immediately!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras_big/22e391b275fddc44458bc8e31c714ff8.webp?t=1787386762 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/55469d4305fa6cbebd0925475a19e845.poster.avif?t=1787386762\" width=534 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/55469d4305fa6cbebd0925475a19e845.webm?t=1787386762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/55469d4305fa6cbebd0925475a19e845.mp4?t=1787386762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events demand immediate action through the skills you unlock. Correct use and good timing will be key to your survival. The events you come across can be either naturally occurring, like rain, drought and insects – or might be caused by human influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/2a557c665a6f6a24e6c7de260bfb3194.avif?t=1787386762\" alt=\"DIVIDER: For a better future!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras_big/2a557c665a6f6a24e6c7de260bfb3194.webp?t=1787386762 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VIVID</strong> is being developed in close exchange with its community –<strong> join our Discord!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space for chats, feedback, and discussions around <strong>VIVID</strong> and meaningful video games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind-the-scenes insights into the development and background of our debut project</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A central hub for community activities and support-related topics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo or Early Access?</strong> We’re still deciding what comes after gamescom 2026 – updates coming soon!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VIVID</strong> is funded by Mitteldeutsche Medienförderung GmbH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strict Non Gen-AI policy:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All visual assets, animations, soundtrack and sound design are created by real artists. We do not use generative AI in the creation of our game content.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras/beffdd4c72a8361b8e9365203b7410a4.avif?t=1787386762\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171050/extras_big/beffdd4c72a8361b8e9365203b7410a4.webp?t=1787386762 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the life of a plant in a calm, atmospheric exploration game about growth, responsibility, and the long-term impact of humans' actions on our environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a living, reactive world shaped by procedural systems, <strong>VIVID</strong> invites you to slow down. Observe how plants grow, how ecosystems evolve, and how even small decisions can leave lasting traces. Ecological responsibility and long-term consequences are central themes – mechanically and narratively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: